	(descr "Everlight 27-21 right-angle (side view) chip LED, 1.7 x 1.1 x 0.6 mm, lens toward -Y. Pads from LCSC's land pattern for C74270 (0.6 x 0.8 at +/-0.75), which is smaller than Everlight's proposed 1.0 x 1.0 at 1.9 mm pitch, so it fits beside the BOOT switch. Pad 1 = cathode (-X), pad 2 = anode. Body outline from the Everlight 27-21 drawing.")
